			"widgets_values":[
				"The young woman from image0, promoting the cosmetic product from image1 while wearing the black “bernini” T-shirt from image2 and the tropical floral shorts from image3, stands in the campus street setting from image4, facing the camera in a medium-full shot. Generate a 5-second video where the woman from image0 is the main subject, keeping her same facial features, long dark hair, soft smile, and gentle youthful appearance. She is dressed in the black short-sleeve T-shirt from image2 with the white word “bernini” across the chest, and the bright tropical floral shorts from image3 with vivid flowers and green leaves. She is holding and promoting the white cosmetic tube from image1 in a natural advertisement-style pose. Keep the background unchanged from image4: a clean campus road with modern red-brick academic buildings, trees on both sides, and a bright daytime sky. At the start, she is already standing centered on the road, facing the camera, holding the cosmetic tube near her chest. Then she gently raises the product toward the camera, smiles confidently, slightly turns her body to show her outfit, and presents the product with one hand. After that, she continues with subtle natural motions such as a soft head tilt, a small step forward, light hair movement, and a calm promotional gesture, while always remaining the clear focus of the frame. The motion should feel smooth, realistic, youthful, and visually appealing, like a clean lifestyle beauty advertisement."
